    "summary": "Implements `wire-witness sidecar` over the spec 005 protocol and the spec 013 live runtime: one supervised attempt per process, exact AttemptBinding and terminal schema versions, a statecraft/wire-exchange/v1 manifest with a fixed member set, a producer identity Statecraft can pin, and the compatibility, rollback, and qualification records a release must carry.\n",
